---
// Restyled on the template's `#about` section. The template's pie-chart
// skill bars and personal-history timeline are dropped — no equivalent
// content exists for this company.
---

<section id="about">
  <div class="diag-divider diag-divider--paper" aria-hidden="true" />
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="section-heading">Who we are</h1>
    <div class="row pad40 reveal">
      <div class="col-md-10 col-md-offset-1">
        <p class="lead-paragraph">
          Magnus Ark is a corporate technology company. We build the
          platforms, run the operations, and support the marketing that
          online entertainment and gaming businesses depend on.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row pad40 reveal">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <p class="left-align">
          We were established to do one thing properly: build and run
          dependable technology for online entertainment and gaming in the
          Philippines, at a standard that holds up to scrutiny. That means
          the systems are engineered in-house rather than assembled from
          parts we do not control. It means the teams handling customer
          accounts, verification, and payments sit inside our own
          organisation, on our own floor, under our own training. And it
          means security and reliability are designed into the platform at
          the start, not added later.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <p class="left-align">
          The Philippine market is young and competitive. We think that is
          the right environment for a company that would rather earn trust
          through the quality of its work than ask for it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #about {
    position: relative;
  }

  .lead-paragraph {
    font-size: 1.25em;
    line-height: 1.5em;
  }
</style>
